<mxfile host="local"><diagram name="banto-id-propagation"><mxGraphModel dx="1240" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1240" pageHeight="900" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="title" value="<b>OpenBanto — 番頭ID伝播 &amp; 職人 per-user 強制</b>" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0b2545;strokeColor=#0b2545;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="24" width="1160" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="uA" value="<b>Slack ユーザー A</b><br>Slack User ID: U0AAA…" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f0fe;strokeColor=#33475b;fontFamily=IPAGothic;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="100" width="210" height="74" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="uB" value="<b>Slack ユーザー B</b><br>Slack User ID: U0BBB…" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f0fe;strokeColor=#33475b;fontFamily=IPAGothic;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="100" width="210" height="74" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="uC" value="<b>… 10人以上</b><br>各自の Slack ID" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f0fe;strokeColor=#33475b;fontFamily=IPAGothic;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="100" width="210" height="74" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="gw" value="<b>OpenBanto 番頭（gateway）</b><br>発話者を識別：Slack ID → userKey（正規化）" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d7f2e3;strokeColor=#33475b;fontFamily=IPAGothic;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="220" width="910" height="74" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="eng" value="<b>エンジン（claude / OpenAI互換）が MCP ツールを呼ぶ</b><br>※ bob はツール非対応" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff4d6;strokeColor=#33475b;fontFamily=IPAGothic;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="336" width="910" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="inj" value="<b>★ コアが毎ターン『今喋っている人』の identity を全ツールへ自動注入（回避不能）</b><br>stdio 職人 → env：JINN_USER_ID / JINN_USER_KEY / JINN_USER_NAME<br>HTTP 職人 → header：X-Banto-User-Id / X-Banto-User-Key / X-Banto-User-Name（+ Authorization 保持）" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe0e0;strokeColor=#c0392b;fontFamily=IPAGothic;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="446" width="910" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sk1" value="<b>calendar 職人</b><br>予定登録/一覧/空き" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9e2f7;strokeColor=#33475b;fontFamily=IPAGothic;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="606" width="200" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sk2" value="<b>議事録 職人</b><br>文字起こし→要約→保存" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9e2f7;strokeColor=#33475b;fontFamily=IPAGothic;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="345" y="606" width="200" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sk3" value="<b>台帳(ledger) 職人</b><br>📌重要発言の収集" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9e2f7;strokeColor=#33475b;fontFamily=IPAGothic;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="606" width="200" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sk4" value="<b>knowledge（組込・参照実装）</b><br>read/write/list_knowledge" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#cfe8d8;strokeColor=#1e7d46;fontFamily=IPAGothic;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="795" y="606" width="235" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="st" value="<b>各職人は受け取った user id で永続I/Oを per-user スコープ（＝この形式を強制）</b><br>内蔵 knowledge → users/&lt;userKey&gt;/ に自動スコープ（コードで強制）<br>外部 HTTP 職人 → 職人コントラクトで X-Banto-User-Id 必須（契約で強制）" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef2f5;strokeColor=#33475b;fontFamily=IPAGothic;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="716" width="910" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg" value="<b>3層で強制</b><br><br>① コアが必ず渡す<br>（回避不能）<br><br>② 内蔵ツールは<br>コードで強制<br><br>③ 外部職人は<br>契約で必須" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fbeee0;strokeColor=#b9770e;fontFamily=IPAGothic;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1045" y="220" width="180" height="344" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#55607a;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="uA" target="gw"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#55607a;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="uB" target="gw"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#55607a;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="uC" target="gw"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#55607a;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="gw" target="eng"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#55607a;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="eng" target="inj"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#55607a;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="inj" target="sk1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#55607a;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="inj" target="sk2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#55607a;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="inj" target="sk3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e9" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#55607a;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="inj" target="sk4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e10" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#55607a;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="sk1" target="st"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e11" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#55607a;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="sk2" target="st"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e12" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#55607a;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="sk3" target="st"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e13" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#55607a;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="sk4" target="st"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>